        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7507, Satin Stainless Steel Round Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ultra contemporary design very large 3-9/16\" diameter round stainless steel flush cup pull from Omnia hardware is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches, and abrasions. It features a satin stainless steel finish with hidden screw mounting. <b>Oversized</b>, the  Round Stainless Steel Cup Pull is easy to grip.  It certainly makes a big impression.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on pocket doors, sliding doors, sliding barn doors, or cabinet doors. Use on any door where a flush with the door face pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7507 Stainless Round Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: .050\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #8 3/4\" mounting screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7507-template.pdf?v=1704262252\"><b>Omnia 7507 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Oversized - 3-9/16\" Diameter</b>. Will NOT fit back to back on a 1-3/8\" thick door. Door must be 1-1/2\" or thicker for back to back installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
